# Vars required by the second-brain-agent service.
# Used by scripts/service-env to extract a minimal .env for deployment.
# Only these secrets reach the service; the master /opt/homelab/.env is never mounted.
#
# SECOND_BRAIN_AGENT_TS_AUTHKEY: the ts-agent sidecar's Tailscale auth key.
# Reusable, non-ephemeral, tag:server. Skipped silently until its op:// ref
# exists in .env.template. Without it the node can't authenticate and the
# agent is unreachable over the tailnet.
SECOND_BRAIN_AGENT_TS_AUTHKEY
